  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.30: Fix alpha.29 Change EHE overcount by preserving complete repository normalization context and re-estimating proven selected final endpoints, excluding discarded intermediate expansion. Keep explicit conservative uncertainty for unproven selections and preserve daily checkpoint lineage. Add native historical author-period discovery and exact retained rewrite/squash reconciliation. Change EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated under change-seed/0.21.0 and change-portfolio/0.6.0; repository seed-rules/0.4.0 priors and admission boundaries remain unchanged. Replacement stock and signed snapshot deltas remain separate measurements. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.30/CHANGELOG.md",
